flowchart TB
    Source[Source changes] --> Scan[Secret and vulnerability scans]
    Scan --> Image[Immutable container image]
    Image --> Runtime[Restricted Kubernetes runtime]
    Runtime --> Network[Private subnets and controlled egress]
    Runtime --> Identity[IRSA / least-privilege pod identity]
    Runtime --> Observe[Health probes, metrics, logs]

    subgraph RuntimeControls[Runtime controls]
      NonRoot[runAsNonRoot]
      NoPrivilege[No privilege escalation]
      ReadOnly[Read-only root filesystem]
      DropCaps[Drop ALL capabilities]
      Seccomp[RuntimeDefault seccomp]
      NoToken[No service-account token automount]
    end
    Runtime --> RuntimeControls
